| Function/Class                | Purpose                                                                 |
|-------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| `generateSecretKey`           | Deterministically generate a secret key from a seed for a given key type|
| `deriveDeterministicRootKey`  | Deterministically derive a valid secp256k1 secret key from a seed       |
| `copy_uint32`                 | Write a 32-bit integer to a buffer in big-endian order                  |

